## Ordem de execução sugerida

```
1. times/domain  →  ITeamRepository (novas assinaturas) + GetTeamById (use case)
2. times/infra   →  MockTeamRepository (getById + getPlayersByTeam + seed atualizado)
3. times/main    →  makeGetTeamById factory
4. times/presentation  →  useTeamDetail → CardConquistas → MoldeJogadores → TelaTime
5. app/times/[teamId].tsx + _layout.tsx (registro) + TimesScreen (link)

6. apostas/presentation  →  TelaPalpite (usa hooks/factory já prontos)
7. app/palpite/[matchId].tsx + _layout.tsx + ContainerAposta (link)

8. album/presentation  →  CompartilhBtn → TelaMercado
9. app/mercado.tsx + _layout.tsx + ProfileScreen (link)
```

